{"id":"8c8a8e761d3e8227","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-projective-set.md","title":"ZFC Projective Set","display":"df-zfc-projective-set — ZFC Projective Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-projective-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-projective-set","58-df-zfc-descriptive2-projective-set"],"display":"df-zfc-projective-set — ZFC Projective Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-projective-hierarchy-level.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-projective-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-projective-set</span><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive2-projective-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-projective-set — ZFC Projective Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e1c26f82e22425ac\" href=\"?note=e1c26f82e22425ac\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-projective-hierarchy-level.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-projective-hierarchy-level.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,X,n\\in V\">\\(A,X,n\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProjectiveHierarchyLevel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ProjectiveHierarchyLevel}_S\\)</span> (boldface projective-level predicate on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e1c26f82e22425ac\" href=\"?note=e1c26f82e22425ac\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-projective-hierarchy-level.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-projective-hierarchy-level.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProjectiveSet}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ProjectiveSet}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (projective-set predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2ProjectiveSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2ProjectiveSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (level-specific alias)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}projective\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ProjectiveSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow \\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ProjectiveHierarchyLevel}_S(A,n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}projective\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ProjectiveSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow \\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ProjectiveHierarchyLevel}_S(A,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}projective\\text{-}set\\text{-}alias}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2ProjectiveSet}_S(A,X,n)\\leftrightarrow X=\\omega^\\omega\\land\\mathrm{ProjectiveHierarchyLevel}_S(A,n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}projective\\text{-}set\\text{-}alias}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2ProjectiveSet}_S(A,X,n)\\leftrightarrow X=\\omega^\\omega\\land\\mathrm{ProjectiveHierarchyLevel}_S(A,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The canonical ambient space is Baire space; the upstream level predicate supplies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span>, and membership in a boldface <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_n\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_n\\)</span> or <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\Pi^1_n\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\Pi^1_n\\)</span> pointclass.</li>\n<li>Projective subsets of other standard Borel spaces are obtained by the usual Borel-isomorphism transport rather than by an untyped ambient-space parameter.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-projective-hierarchy-level.md","status":"resolved","id":"e1c26f82e22425ac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-projective-hierarchy-level.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-projective-hierarchy-level.md","status":"resolved","id":"e1c26f82e22425ac","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProjectiveHierarchyLevel}_S$ (boldface projective-level predicate on $\\omega^\\omega$, see [[../batch16/58-df-zfc-projective-hierarchy-level.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,X,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProjectiveHierarchyLevel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProjectiveSet}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2ProjectiveSet}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}projective\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ProjectiveSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow \\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ProjectiveHierarchyLevel}_S(A,n)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive2\\text{-}projective\\text{-}set\\text{-}alias}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive2ProjectiveSet}_S(A,X,n)\\leftrightarrow X=\\omega^\\omega\\land\\mathrm{ProjectiveHierarchyLevel}_S(A,n)","display":true},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n>0","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\Sigma^1_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\Pi^1_n","display":false}],"bytes":1502,"backlinks":[{"id":"1f927fd79207edda","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProjectiveSet}_S$ (boldface projective-set predicate on Baire space, see [[../batch17/58-df-zfc-projective-set.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3209","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-projective-set.md|58-df-zfc-projective-set]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","e1c26f82e22425ac"]}